{"id": "g2_merge_half_open_overlaps_only", "signature": "solve(windows)", "statement": "`windows` is a list of [start, end] pairs of integers describing HALF-OPEN intervals [start, end). Two windows are merged only when they share at least one time point; windows that merely touch (one ends at t and the other starts at t) stay separate. Windows with start >= end are empty and are dropped. Return the merged windows as a list of [start, end] lists sorted by start. Return [] when no non-empty window remains. The input list must not be modified.", "tests": [{"args": [[]], "expected": []}, {"args": [[[1, 3], [3, 5]]], "expected": [[1, 3], [3, 5]]}, {"args": [[[1, 4], [3, 6]]], "expected": [[1, 6]]}, {"args": [[[5, 5], [2, 2]]], "expected": []}, {"args": [[[6, 8], [1, 3], [2, 7], [10, 12]]], "expected": [[1, 8], [10, 12]]}, {"args": [[[0, 10], [2, 3], [4, 5]]], "expected": [[0, 10]]}, {"args": [[[1, 2], [2, 3], [3, 4]]], "expected": [[1, 2], [2, 3], [3, 4]]}, {"args": [[[4, 9], [0, 4], [9, 10]]], "expected": [[0, 4], [4, 9], [9, 10]]}, {"args": [[[3, 4], [1, 2]]], "expected": [[1, 2], [3, 4]]}, {"args": [[[-2, 1], [0, 0], [-1, 5]]], "expected": [[-2, 5]]}, {"args": [[[1, 5], [1, 5]]], "expected": [[1, 5]]}], "facts": [["arg", "windows", "interval_list"], ["iterate", "windows"], ["ask", "merge_intervals"], ["interval_ends", "half_open"], ["size", "windows", "tiny"]], "deps": {"schema": ["interval_scan"], "uses": ["interval_merge"], "solution_sha256": "bb91f21df22022dce7a60ad5813bbb0a15a30aef08dbee02b658dde8dc4cff1b", "reference_sha256": "629a6d7bfecc1ceae9d2e4329973421a605b1c4ca7ce727bd6ae2e76bc60a0a0"}}